  "approach": "Name the objects around a classroom or office with audio for each word, add the teacher instructions a learner will hear, then practice by following instructions and naming things.",
  "coverage": [
    "Objects: el libro, el cuaderno, el lápiz, el bolígrafo (la pluma in Mexico), la mesa, la silla, la puerta, la ventana, el pizarrón",
